  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021 IOM Belarus Response Plan covering November 1, 2021 to April 30, 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide immediate protection-sensitive humanitarian assistance and contribute to sustainable protection solutions for stranded migrants in Belarus, including facilitating their voluntary humanitarian return. IOM will prioritize this funding for food, shelter, non-food items (NFIs), Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH), protection, and emergency health assistance and Mental Health and Psychosocial Support Services (MHPSS).</narrative>
  </description>
